# Session handoff notes. Kept locally, deliberately untracked: the file is a
# working instrument rather than documentation, it carries an absolute path
# from whichever machine last wrote it, and its dated status lines go stale
# faster than anyone refreshes them. Anything in it that a reader of this
# repository needs belongs in `docs/` or a comment at the code it describes --
# see "The repcode substitution" in `docs/PARITY_PLAN.md`, which was extracted
# from it for exactly that reason.
/dev/HANDOFF.md

# Agent worktrees. Scaffolding, not project configuration -- a tracked
# `.claude/settings.json` is still welcome beside them.
.claude/worktrees/
